OL,3,GNEWSAChristmas market cancelled over
OL,4,Acosts and staffing
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Christmas market held in a town in
OL,7,FNottinghamshire has been cancelled due
OL,8,Fto rising costs and lack of volunteers.
OL,10,FThe Kimberley market, which attracted
OL,11,Fmore than 80 stalls, was handed over to
OL,12,Fthe town council in 2024 after being
OL,13,Frun by volunteers for more than a
OL,14,Fdecade.
OL,16,FThe council said a number of factors,
OL,17,Fincluding a lack of financially viable
OL,18,Findoor venues, rising safety and
OL,19,Ftraffic management costs, falling
OL,20,Fvolunteer numbers and difficulties
OL,21,Fgetting a "sufficient variety" of
OL,22,Fstalls, had forced the cancellation.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,369,360,200,160,0,100
