OL,3,GNEWSAChristmas market cancelled over
OL,4,Acosts and staffing
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a statement on social media,
OL,7,Fofficials said it was "a decision that
OL,8,Fwas incredibly difficult for us to
OL,9,Fmake".
